{"id":"mise_rable","lemma":"misérable","pos":"adj","rank":2914,"glosses":["destitute, impoverished","seedy, shabby","wretched, pitiful"],"ipa":"/mi.ze.ʁabl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/Fr-mis%C3%A9rable.ogg/Fr-mis%C3%A9rable.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"misérables"},"formAudio":{"misérables":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-mis%C3%A9rables.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu dois être misérable.","en":"You must be miserable.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"J'étais misérable et malheureux.","en":"I was miserable and unhappy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"unhappy, miserable"}]},{"text":"Je n'ai été payé que deux misérables dollars.","en":"I was only paid a measly two dollars.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to pay","l":"payer"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"two"},null,{"g":"dollar","l":"dollar"}]},{"text":"Je sais que Tom est misérable.","en":"I know Tom is miserable.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"that / what"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Le salaire est misérable et les heures sont longues.","en":"The pay is terrible and the hours are long.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"salary, wage"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"long","l":"long"}]}]}